Holodor provenance: OURS (2026-10-02), a fix on top of ROCKNIX's 0073 (kept verbatim).
Found on the Odin 3 jack with the UCA202 rig: PCM path + compander off = mono.

From: transentient <11418311+transentient@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: wcd939x: HPH PCM: program the crosstalk coefficients with the compander off

wcd939x_hph_pcm_pre_dac() (added by 0073, HPH PCM/HiFi mode) returned early when the
compander was off, before writing the RX_TOP_HPHx_PATH_SEC0/2/3 crosstalk
coefficients. wcd939x_hph_pcm_pre_pa() enables the crosstalk block for both
channels regardless (RX_TOP_PATH_CFG2 = 0x0f), so with the compander off the
block ran with zeroed coefficients and folded L and R together: measured on
the AYN Odin 3 jack, a left-only and a right-only tone came out equally on
both channels (mono). Android and ROCKNIX both leave SEC0/2/3 at
0x1f/0x11/0x4f during playback.

Write the coefficients before the compander-off return so both cases get them.
---
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/wcd939x.c
@@ -535,6 +535,15 @@
 					      WCD939X_REFBUFF_UHQA_CTL_REFBUFN_IOUT_CTL, 1);
 	}
 
+	/*
+	 * crosstalk coefficients (stock: scale 0x1f, sec2/3 0x11/0x4f);
+	 * pre_pa enables the crosstalk block either way, and left at zero
+	 * it folds L and R together (mono on the jack)
+	 */
+	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 0, 0x1f);
+	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 3, 0x4f);
+	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 2, 0x11);
+
 	if (!comp_en) {
 		/* compander bypassed, gain from register */
 		if (hphr)
@@ -583,11 +592,6 @@
 	else
 		snd_soc_component_write_field(component, WCD939X_DIGITAL_CDC_COMP_CTL_0,
 					      WCD939X_CDC_COMP_CTL_0_HPHL_COMP_EN, true);
-
-	/* crosstalk coefficients (stock: scale 0x1f, sec2/3 0x11/0x4f) */
-	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 0, 0x1f);
-	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 3, 0x4f);
-	snd_soc_component_write(component, sec_base + 2, 0x11);
 }
 
 static void wcd939x_hph_pcm_post_dac(struct snd_soc_component *component)
